02:10.520 --> 02:15.760
We're not yet established it's not yet time to move against them today the Ministry of Revenue calculated tax revenue.

02:15.840 --> 02:21.480
Totaling over 18 million taels can shield Your Highness from wind and rain, block swords and spears.

02:21.920 --> 02:23.320
It is Huan's fortune.

