Your Highness, this old minister finally sees you everyone has their own account in their heart.

02:32.360 --> 02:34.920
If you stay away too long.

02:36.360 --> 02:40.200
I'll name the child myself speaking of defeat before the battle.

02:40.280 --> 02:45.400
Since it's a fight to the death, I won't be a coward Your Majesty, what do you need?

02:45.480 --> 02:51.240
Just order your servant to do it five hundred it is five hundred men strike first.

02:51.640 --> 02:53.080
No more talk, come.

02:56.880 --> 03:02.840
Prince of Jin is rebelling I am ordered to capture him surrender.

03:03.040 --> 03:05.040
