03:06.800 --> 03:10.640
This northern expedition our goal is to recapture Beiyu Pass.

03:11.680 --> 03:17.173
Your Highness, Prince of Jin I'm Liu Dadao Commander of the Yong'an Garrison Left Army.

03:17.920 --> 03:23.400
