03:26.160 --> 03:30.747
Your Majesty when you were in Yiyang, you promised Grandfather.

03:31.080 --> 03:36.760
To protect your servant for a lifetime of peace and joy Your daughter bids farewell.

03:37.840 --> 03:41.800
May Father Emperor take care of his sacred body.

03:45.360 --> 03:47.000
Do you think the people kneel to you for nothing?

03:47.080 --> 03:52.400
They kneel to me, to Princess Xunyang can't catch a wolf without sacrificing the child Your son is willing to be the vanguard.

