05:55.560 --> 06:01.240
Some heroes are made by history while some heroes make history.

06:02.280 --> 06:07.800
The ambition to look north at the realm will forever exist because of you.

06:07.880 --> 06:11.000
Ending: Unification of the Nine Provinces Achieved.

